Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix: drop the whole compound extension when deriving CTS
 passwords

Real CTS objects are named .xsvn.csv, so stripping one or two known
extensions left '.xsvn' in the final segment and derivation threw.

Co-Authored-By: Graham McVea <graham.mcvea@bartonkeys.com>
